    "txnflow": {
      "fill": "green",
      "maxH": 760,
      "text": "TRANSACTIONS FLOW\n\nEntry points\n• Nav tab → T1 Transactions list\n• Home ‘Scan receipt’ → Camera\n• T1 ‘+’ → T2 Add sheet\n\nAdd by scan (SRS 3.1.2)\nT2 Scan a receipt → Camera → Processing → Receipt scan review → Save → T1 (toast: saved)\nIf OCR fails → Scan failed → Try again / Enter manually (T3)\n\nAdd manually (SRS 3.1.1)\nT2 Enter manually → T3 New expense → Category → T4 picker → back to T3 → Save → T1 (toast: saved)\n\nView / edit\nT1 tap a row → T5 Detail → Edit → T6 Edit form → Save → T5\n\nDelete\nT5 (or T6) Delete → T7 Confirm → Delete → T1 (toast: deleted · Undo)\n\nRules\n• Nothing saves without user confirmation\n• Every save, edit or delete recalculates budgets\n• Search + month + category filters on T1",
      "w": 380,
      "x": 2820,
      "y": 4504
    }
